Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.83,0:00:13.38,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\c&H4E4E4E&\pos(567.58,847.4)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(20,140,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(40,160,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(61,181,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(81,201,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(101,221,\alpha&H00&)}8{\alpha&HFF&\t(122,242,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(142,262,\alpha&H00&)}3{\alpha&HFF&\t(163,283,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(183,303,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(203,323,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(224,344,\alpha&H00&)}H{\alpha&HFF&\t(244,364,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(265,385,\alpha&H00&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(285,405,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(305,425,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(326,446,\alpha&H00&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(346,466,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(366,486,\alpha&H00&)}a {\alpha&HFF&\t(387,507,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(407,527,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(428,548,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(448,568,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(468,588,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(489,609,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(509,629,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(530,650,\alpha&H00&)}r
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forty-seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And 50!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of 50 chops, I only\Nheard three good ones there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.59,0:00:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, that brings your total to 41.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:00:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Eugeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like the cereal water's\Non you. Again. Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got, what, 43 good chops so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll catch up soon. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn at the axe, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.01,0:01:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day for the past\Nyear and three months,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've been hacking away at this darn tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use complaining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our calling's to cut the giga-cedar\Ndown, so there's no getting out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know you're right, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel like\Nwe're getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's its life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it two months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.55,0:01:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was at 235,590?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.83,0:01:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After two months of chopping at it,\Nwe only got its life down a lousy 50!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take us forever to cut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tree's as strong as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six generations of carvers worked\Non it for 300 years to get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.97,0:02:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll get cut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In 900 years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're such a smarty-pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you use that big brain of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.11,0:02:26.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to figure out how to\Nget us out of this job?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.55,0:02:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.87,0:02:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want more or do you give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.11,0:02:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit payback time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stop it! Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd find you boys goofing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonkii it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did your sacred arts\Nclass let out early today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.77,0:03:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause, like, you're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not early at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you have the energy to wrestle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe I should tell old man Kirito to\Nadd some more swings to your daily quota.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.39,0:03:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time you had some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better eat it fast before it spoils.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pie sure tastes good today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice, your cooking keeps\Ngetting better. For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turned out okay, I guess,\Nbut it could have been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.37,0:04:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything, I wish we could take our\Ntime eating this instead of rushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.85,0:04:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does food have to spoil\Nso fast when it's hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in winter, we leave raw meat out and\Nit keeps for days as long as it's salted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.97,0:04:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because it's cold in winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we could keep food cold in\Nsummer, too, it would last way longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to make it snow, you'd have to use\Nthe forbidden weather-altering arts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then an Integrity Knight from the Axiom\NChurch would come and take you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.85,0:04:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.59,0:04:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had lots of ice, we\Ncould keep the food cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we could take our time\Nand enjoy Alice's lunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we go have ourselves a quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.71,0:04:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A quest for ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's summer now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where would you find\Nice this time of year?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the market at Senator is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, remember that story about one\Nof the village founders, Bercoli?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which story?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.91,0:05:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Bercouli and\Nthe Northern White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He followed the Rural River\Nall the way to its source,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the cave at the foot of the End Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went in and found a pile of treasure\Nwith a big white dragon sleeping on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, he grabbed a sword sticking out\Nof the treasure, and the dragon woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The story also says he saw giant icicles\Na little ways past the mouth of the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.77,0:05:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we go and get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.73,0:05:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you know the law of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says we can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says kids aren't allowed\Nto play anywhere near the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End Mountains unless they\Nhave a grown-up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.45,0:06:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we're there looking\Nfor ice, that's not playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our village had ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the food would last longer\Nand that would benefit everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we went to get some, it'd\Nbe considered work, not play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd totally be work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe but we wouldn't just be breaking\Nthe village's law by going up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be breaking the other one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.53,0:06:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The taboo index.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's allowed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, but here's what\Nit says about the End Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In book 1, chapter 3, verse 11,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.19,0:06:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the index says none shall\Ncross the end mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that surround the human empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.27,0:06:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it means entering the dark territory\Non the other side of the End Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't say anything\Nabout going in the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.03,0:06:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be the end of the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:07:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weekend we'll find that dra\N- I mean, find that ice cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's meet in\Nthe morning at seven by
Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&H8A8B89&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.7\t(24,441,\c&HF7F4F1&)\pos(1368.18,867.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(17,137,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(34,154,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(51,171,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(68,188,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(85,205,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(102,222,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,240,\alpha&H00&)}3{\alpha&HFF&\t(137,257,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(154,274,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(171,291,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(188,308,\alpha&H00&)}H{\alpha&HFF&\t(205,325,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(223,343,\alpha&H00&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(240,360,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(257,377,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(274,394,\alpha&H00&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(291,411,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(308,428,\alpha&H00&)}a {\alpha&HFF&\t(325,445,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(343,463,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(360,480,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(377,497,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(394,514,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(411,531,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(428,548,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(446,566,\alpha&H00&)}r
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.71,0:07:12.30,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\c&H3E3E3E&\3c&H3E3E3E&\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur1\pos(1370.18,869.2)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(17,137,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(34,154,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(51,171,\alpha&H00&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(68,188,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(85,205,\alpha&H00&)}1{\alpha&HFF&\t(102,222,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,240,\alpha&H00&)}3{\alpha&HFF&\t(137,257,\alpha&H00&)}7{\alpha&HFF&\t(154,274,\alpha&H00&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(171,291,\alpha&H00&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(188,308,\alpha&H00&)}H{\alpha&HFF&\t(205,325,\alpha&H00&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(223,343,\alpha&H00&)}m{\alpha&HFF&\t(240,360,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(257,377,\alpha&H00&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(274,394,\alpha&H00&)}E{\alpha&HFF&\t(291,411,\alpha&H00&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(308,428,\alpha&H00&)}a {\alpha&HFF&\t(325,445,\alpha&H00&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(343,463,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(360,480,\alpha&H00&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(377,497,\alpha&H00&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(394,514,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(411,531,\alpha&H00&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(428,548,\alpha&H00&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(446,566,\alpha&H00&)}r
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the north gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.61,0:07:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, and don't\Noversleep. Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making us carry everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.03,0:07:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does she think we are, her servants?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be happy we can still go\Nand do stuff with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll end soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the village elder's\Ndaughter, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to learn all that stuff\Na lady's supposed to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like manners and etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and since she wasn't\Ngiven a calling like we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were She has to study all\Nthose sacred art skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to be a role\Nmodel for the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.57,0:07:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means no more playing\Nwith us boys anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.29,0:07:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the two of you\Nwhispering about back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing? Right? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just saying how\Nwe'd get in trouble if
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:08:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't make it back\Nbefore the evening bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then keep an eye on Solus, and when it's\Nin the middle of the sky, we'll head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back to our quest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pretty far from the village now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know back in the olden days,\Nback when Rulid was first founded?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.53,0:08:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,goblins and orcs came down\Nfrom the Dark Territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,raided the village and stole\Na bunch of sheep and kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you're trying\Nto scare me, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Integrity Knight came from Senator\Nand chased them all away in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.27,0:08:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ever since,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on clear days you'll see a Silver Dragon\NKnight soaring above the End Mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all saw that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.31,0:09:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We reached the Yen Mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's why we came here after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.09,0:09:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Luminous Elements. Adhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.49,0:09:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't see any icicles yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say they were\Nsupposed to be a little ways in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, did I? You did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.43,0:10:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please bring\Nthat light over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.91,0:10:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.71,0:10:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's colder now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it totally is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a second there, I thought I\Nwas coming down with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of neat how it's winter\Nin here, but summer outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we'll find some ice further in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hopefully not too much further in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do if we happen\Nto come across a white dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll run away as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.79,0:10:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt it's going to\Nmind if we take a couple icicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it'd be neat if we could\Ngrab one of its scales though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we are not doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.43,0:11:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else are we going to prove\Nwe saw a real live dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true, there's ice in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet you guys there's\Neven more up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.05,0:11:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this much ice, we can keep\Nall the food in the village cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck, with this much ice, you can keep\Nthe whole Tonkii village cold forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, would you watch where you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:11:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huchio, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.91,0:12:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.95,0:12:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.59,0:12:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.85,0:12:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did it die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.89,0:12:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its claws all covered in gouges.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then it was chopped clean off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it must have fought with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know of anything\Nthat could kill a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sword made these marks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.57,0:12:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious what killed it. A human.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a sword master like\NBercouli couldn't fight it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who'd be strong enough to kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Integrity Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The White Dragons protect our realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.47,0:12:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would an Integrity Knight\Nfrom the Axiom Church kill one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Dark Territory has strong\Nknights too, and one of them killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then the Armies of Darkness could easily\Ncross the End Mountains and attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is heavier than it looks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.71,0:13:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the sword? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same one Bercouli tried to steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.27,0:13:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Blue Rose Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.73,0:13:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't lift it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with Eugeo's help, we'd\Nnever carry this back to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of other\Ntreasure we could take, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something about\Nthat doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be like grave robbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just take ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon won't mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:13:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it's just\Ngoing to end up melting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.63,0:14:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less as long as\Nit makes our meals last longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just our meals, everyone's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should start heading back now, or else\Nwe won't make it to town before dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.25,0:14:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you remember which\Ntunnel we came in from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been walking a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the right tunnel,\Nor was it the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We picked this one because\Nyou said we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You picked the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost to the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.76,0:14:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful or you'll\Ntrip and hurt yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dark territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:32.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon Knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.81,0:15:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That white one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a real-life\NIntegrity Knight, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the others from the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.99,0:16:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.97,0:16:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Book 1, Chapter 3, Verse 11,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the index says, None shall cross the End\NMountains that surround the human empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Alice. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's not like you left the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't, did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A singular unit has been detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.01,0:18:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tracing its ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coordinates fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.39,0:18:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Report complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.19,0:18:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, guys, where are we going to put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put the ice in my basement\Nwhere it's nice and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think tomorrow's lunch will\Nbe the best one yet. Can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.55,0:18:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.07,0:19:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.61,0:19:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Integrity Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's the same one from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.81,0:20:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's come for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he can't take her away for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! Eugeo! Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better get out of here before he sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.77,0:20:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.39,0:21:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Gosfut Zuburg, the\Nelder of this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Deo Selbert Synthesis 7,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Axiom Integrity Knight who oversees\Nthe northern Norlingarth territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter, Alice Zuburg,\Nhas disobeyed the taboo index.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall take her with me to answer\Nfor her crimes and be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.59,0:21:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taboo Index,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Book 1, Chapter 3, Verse 11 states, None\Nshall cross into the dark territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.41,0:22:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice never set foot\Nin the Dark Territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.29,0:22:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.79,0:22:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All she did was touch the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.83,0:22:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is enough to charge\Nher with the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we're just as guilty as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.87,0:22:20.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were right there with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.87,0:22:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you take her, then take us too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh, listen, I'm gonna\Ncharge him with the axe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab Alice and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.73,0:22:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I don't, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.45,0:22:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.29,0:22:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her life's more important\Nthan some stupid old rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Escort those two children from the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.55,0:23:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there! Go help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.37,0:23:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,U-U-Gio, get these guys off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.37,0:23:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.79,0:23:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,U-U-Gio!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.81,0:23:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.41,0:24:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
