Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.13,0:25:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.23,0:25:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This turning costume is full auto!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.63,0:25:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, you PK jerks?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.87,0:25:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how fast you run!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.17,0:26:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.95,0:26:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up! I'll cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.61,0:26:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those Photon Swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.47,0:26:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Team A needs backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.85,0:26:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B and C, head to Grid 4-6.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.63,0:26:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have permission to\Nuse grenades. Hey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.79,0:26:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me in on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.31,0:26:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this op's about to wind down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.49,0:26:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit back and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.21,0:27:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.45,0:27:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.99,0:27:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the end of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.63,0:27:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All teams retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.89,0:27:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grid 1-9's too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.83,0:28:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could have killed them\Nall if we stuck with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.77,0:28:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to end\Nthe day like this, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.49,0:28:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That team's all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.69,0:28:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting them won't\Nhelp with our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.83,0:28:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the big mission coming\Nup and we need to stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.01,0:28:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.73,0:28:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Till next time, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.73,0:28:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I heard GGO was going to\Nbe hardcore, but that was insane.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:27.12,0:28:30.33,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.4\c&HF2F1F4&\pos(1268.98,883.6)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(2356,2476,\alpha&HFF&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(28,148,\alpha&H00&)\t(2387,2507,\alpha&HFF&)}B{\alpha&HFF&\t(56,176,\alpha&H00&)\t(2419,2539,\alpha&HFF&)}C {\alpha&HFF&\t(84,204,\alpha&H00&)\t(2451,2571,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(113,233,\alpha&H00&)\t(2483,2603,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(141,261,\alpha&H00&)\t(2515,2635,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(169,289,\alpha&H00&)\t(2547,2667,\alpha&HFF&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(198,318,\alpha&H00&)\t(2579,2699,\alpha&HFF&)}k{\alpha&HFF&\t(226,346,\alpha&H00&)\t(2611,2731,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(254,374,\alpha&H00&)\t(2643,2763,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(283,403,\alpha&H00&)\t(2675,2795,\alpha&HFF&)}B{\alpha&HFF&\t(311,431,\alpha&H00&)\t(2707,2827,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(339,459,\alpha&H00&)\t(2738,2858,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(367,487,\alpha&H00&)\t(2770,2890,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H00&)\t(2802,2922,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(424,544,\alpha&H00&)\t(2834,2954,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(452,572,\alpha&H00&)\t(2866,2986,\alpha&HFF&)}O {\alpha&HFF&\t(481,601,\alpha&H00&)\t(2898,3018,\alpha&HFF&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(509,629,\alpha&H00&)\t(2930,3050,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(537,657,\alpha&H00&)\t(2962,3082,\alpha&HFF&)}p{\alpha&HFF&\t(566,686,\alpha&H00&)\t(2994,3114,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(594,714,\alpha&H00&)\t(3026,3146,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(622,742,\alpha&H00&)\t(3058,3178,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(651,771,\alpha&H00&)\t(3090,3210,\alpha&HFF&)}l
Dialogue: 1,0:28:27.24,0:28:30.20,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\c&H404040&\pos(1269.98,884.6)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(2106,2226,\alpha&HFF&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(28,148,\alpha&H00&)\t(2137,2257,\alpha&HFF&)}B{\alpha&HFF&\t(56,176,\alpha&H00&)\t(2169,2289,\alpha&HFF&)}C {\alpha&HFF&\t(84,204,\alpha&H00&)\t(2201,2321,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(113,233,\alpha&H00&)\t(2233,2353,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(141,261,\alpha&H00&)\t(2265,2385,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(169,289,\alpha&H00&)\t(2297,2417,\alpha&HFF&)}c{\alpha&HFF&\t(198,318,\alpha&H00&)\t(2329,2449,\alpha&HFF&)}k{\alpha&HFF&\t(226,346,\alpha&H00&)\t(2361,2481,\alpha&HFF&)}e{\alpha&HFF&\t(254,374,\alpha&H00&)\t(2393,2513,\alpha&HFF&)}n {\alpha&HFF&\t(283,403,\alpha&H00&)\t(2425,2545,\alpha&HFF&)}B{\alpha&HFF&\t(311,431,\alpha&H00&)\t(2457,2577,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(339,459,\alpha&H00&)\t(2488,2608,\alpha&HFF&)}r{\alpha&HFF&\t(367,487,\alpha&H00&)\t(2520,2640,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(396,516,\alpha&H00&)\t(2552,2672,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(424,544,\alpha&H00&)\t(2584,2704,\alpha&HFF&)}G{\alpha&HFF&\t(452,572,\alpha&H00&)\t(2616,2736,\alpha&HFF&)}O {\alpha&HFF&\t(481,601,\alpha&H00&)\t(2648,2768,\alpha&HFF&)}C{\alpha&HFF&\t(509,629,\alpha&H00&)\t(2680,2800,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(537,657,\alpha&H00&)\t(2712,2832,\alpha&HFF&)}p{\alpha&HFF&\t(566,686,\alpha&H00&)\t(2744,2864,\alpha&HFF&)}i{\alpha&HFF&\t(594,714,\alpha&H00&)\t(2776,2896,\alpha&HFF&)}t{\alpha&HFF&\t(622,742,\alpha&H00&)\t(2808,2928,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(651,771,\alpha&H00&)\t(2840,2960,\alpha&HFF&)}l
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never played a game where it's\Ncool just to run around and kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.51,0:28:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, there's a method\Nto the madness of PKing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.85,0:28:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go after other players\Nfor their cashier items.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.45,0:28:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the team we just fought\Ndidn't care about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.91,0:28:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the only thing those guys\Nwanted was to straight up kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.75,0:28:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And did you see all the grenades\Nand smoke bombs they used?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.61,0:28:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that stuff expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.65,0:28:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.95,0:28:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's how they fight\Nevery single time they show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.01,0:29:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They go after teams that are out in the\Nmiddle of nowhere, massacre everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.39,0:29:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then disappear without looting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.79,0:29:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw their stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true they've never lost a battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.31,0:29:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true they haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I thought if anyone\Ncould beat them, we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.51,0:29:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because as a team, we're not like\Nanyone they've come up against yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.41,0:29:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I guess it just\Nwasn't in the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.71,0:29:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect they'd\Nretreat, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.67,0:29:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.33,0:29:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, they ran, so\Nthat's a win in my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.55,0:29:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The point was to find out who they were\Nand what they were up to, tough guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.43,0:29:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, a win's a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.53,0:29:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, it would have been nice\Nto find out the leader's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.41,0:29:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but with the way they fought, it\Nwasn't even clear who the leader was.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.79,0:29:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't flap on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.61,0:29:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I look like a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.67,0:29:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he said he's been taking time off from
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.87,0:29:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,school since Thursday\Nand touring companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.71,0:30:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing him, he's probably mixed\Nup in something sinister again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.05,0:30:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for helping me\Nout, guys. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.45,0:30:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problems. Anytime. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.43,0:30:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today was fun. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.41,0:30:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, bye. No, wait. One sec. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.21,0:30:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was hoping you guys could\Nhelp me with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.23,0:30:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That squad of PKers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.07,0:30:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's something else, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.31,0:30:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you and Kirito have time,\Ncould we meet IRL tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.55,0:30:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.67,0:30:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm free in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to meet at Aikyo's?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.27,0:30:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.35,0:30:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll also email you the plan so\Nyou can think about it, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.49,0:30:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.26,0:30:53.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\c&HE9E5E5&\pos(1414.98,60.933)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(2099,2219,\alpha&HFF&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(33,153,\alpha&H00&)\t(2132,2252,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(67,187,\alpha&H00&)\t(2166,2286,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(100,220,\alpha&H00&)\t(2199,2319,\alpha&HFF&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(134,254,\alpha&H00&)\t(2233,2353,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(167,287,\alpha&H00&)\t(2266,2386,\alpha&HFF&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(201,321,\alpha&H00&)\t(2300,2420,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(235,355,\alpha&H00&)\t(2334,2454,\alpha&HFF&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(268,388,\alpha&H00&)\t(2367,2487,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(302,422,\alpha&H00&)\t(2401,2521,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(335,455,\alpha&H00&)\t(2434,2554,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(369,489,\alpha&H00&)\t(2468,2588,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(403,523,\alpha&H00&)\t(2502,2622,\alpha&HFF&)}8{\alpha&HFF&\t(436,556,\alpha&H00&)\t(2535,2655,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(470,590,\alpha&H00&)\t(2569,2689,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(503,623,\alpha&H00&)\t(2602,2722,\alpha&HFF&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(537,657,\alpha&H00&)\t(2636,2756,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(571,691,\alpha&H00&)\t(2670,2790,\alpha&HFF&)}6
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.38,0:30:52.93,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs72\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\c&H212121&\pos(1415.98,61.93)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(1859,1979,\alpha&HFF&)}S{\alpha&HFF&\t(33,153,\alpha&H00&)\t(1892,2012,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(67,187,\alpha&H00&)\t(1926,2046,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(100,220,\alpha&H00&)\t(1959,2079,\alpha&HFF&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(134,254,\alpha&H00&)\t(1993,2113,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(167,287,\alpha&H00&)\t(2026,2146,\alpha&HFF&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(201,321,\alpha&H00&)\t(2060,2180,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(235,355,\alpha&H00&)\t(2094,2214,\alpha&HFF&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(268,388,\alpha&H00&)\t(2127,2247,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(302,422,\alpha&H00&)\t(2161,2281,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(335,455,\alpha&H00&)\t(2194,2314,\alpha&HFF&)}e {\alpha&HFF&\t(369,489,\alpha&H00&)\t(2228,2348,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(403,523,\alpha&H00&)\t(2262,2382,\alpha&HFF&)}8{\alpha&HFF&\t(436,556,\alpha&H00&)\t(2295,2415,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(470,590,\alpha&H00&)\t(2329,2449,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(503,623,\alpha&H00&)\t(2362,2482,\alpha&HFF&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(537,657,\alpha&H00&)\t(2396,2516,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(571,691,\alpha&H00&)\t(2430,2550,\alpha&HFF&)}6
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.45,0:30:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.89,0:30:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.97,0:30:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.11,0:30:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what is it you wanted to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.93,0:31:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it about B.O.B.? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.23,0:31:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a player calling\Nhimself Akihiko who won B.O.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,4.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.44,0:31:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the same guy who won the first B.O.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.77,0:31:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.19,0:31:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we found out he was in 4,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.43,0:31:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone got excited because\Nhe's like a legend, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.29,0:31:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we all watched the live feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't believe he started\Nwith just his bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.75,0:31:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fought with a confident, stealthy\Nstyle, like that team from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.05,0:31:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did have the same vibe, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.99,0:31:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, except Subtilizer on a\Nwhole other level than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.31,0:31:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed me so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.59,0:31:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even have time to aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how it was for\Neveryone in the tourney.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.29,0:31:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he knew our moves before we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.03,0:31:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.19,0:31:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're all vets at B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.61,0:31:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he anticipate\Neveryone's moves like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.85,0:31:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose as vets there's a\Npredictability to how we play.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.49,0:31:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tend to use the same\Nmoves because they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.63,0:32:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.79,0:32:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking that a player\Nwith a more chaotic fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.85,0:32:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Style might have a better chance\Nat outmaneuvering Subtilizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.67,0:32:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the point is, the next B .O .B.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.35,0:32:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is going to be happening at the end of the\Nyear, and I'd like you to sign up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.09,0:32:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.09,0:32:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm gonna let\Nmyself lose to the same guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.79,0:32:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.69,0:32:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you made some progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.35,0:32:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.47,0:32:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still get the shakes every now\Nand then, but I'm getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.31,0:32:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.63,0:32:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he doing any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.49,0:32:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Shinkawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.43,0:32:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's making progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.09,0:32:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll probably go visit him\Nagain in a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.61,0:32:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.17,0:32:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.49,0:32:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally getting the help he needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.49,0:32:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.01,0:32:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.35,0:32:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His partner's still out there, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.67,0:33:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Kikuoka said they'll\Ncatch up with him soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.91,0:33:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.87,0:33:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Shinanon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.95,0:33:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you just call her?\NHey, Asuna. Right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I read your email about\NB .O .B. 5. I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.77,0:33:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you asked her to help, too? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.65,0:33:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured if it were just you,\Nthere's a chance you'd get to aggro.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.25,0:33:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even good dogs need a\Nleash, right? Tonkii.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.77,0:33:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.85,0:33:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.87,0:33:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.91,0:33:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.85,0:33:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can even tell something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.73,0:33:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that part-time job, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.51,0:33:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.42,0:33:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physically, you're fine, so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.47,0:33:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.83,0:33:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exactly what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.71,0:33:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.62,0:33:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean she can track your vitals?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.81,0:33:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.09,0:33:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.43,0:33:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, like, how's it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.33,0:34:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little while ago, I had this\Nminiature sensor implanted in my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.37,0:34:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sends my heart rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.83,0:34:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,body temperature, and other stuff\Nover the net to us in a smartphone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.77,0:34:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.68,0:34:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you want to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.39,0:34:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an anti-cheating system.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.11,0:34:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not even.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.27,0:34:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I started this part-time job,\Nthey thought it'd be good to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.73,0:34:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to wear electrodes\Nand sticking them
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.87,0:34:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on and pulling them off\Nis kind of a hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.39,0:34:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using it like this was her idea,\Nso I made a little app for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.81,0:34:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something about looking\Nat it's kind of soothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.79,0:34:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that's Kirito's heart beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.57,0:34:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get all woozy and my\Nhead starts to spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.59,0:34:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's both cute and kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.61,0:34:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, with you on my side, I'll\Nhave a machine gun in my pillbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.77,0:34:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're exactly the edge I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.11,0:34:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to help any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.73,0:34:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.65,0:35:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to hear some more about\Nthis sketchy new job of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.45,0:35:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you're alpha\Ntesting a new VR MMO game, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.71,0:35:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it's not a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a brain-machine interface designed\Nfor this brand new full dive system.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.85,0:35:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rath developed it. They're new.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.11,0:35:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck kind of a name is Rath?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.39,0:35:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the name of an imaginary creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.53,0:35:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember it from the book\NThrough the Looking Glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.45,0:35:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some characters said it was\Na pig and others a turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.37,0:35:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, are they releasing some\Nnext-gen full-dive rig for gaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.81,0:35:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.17,0:35:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing's totally different compared\Nto the full-dive tech that's out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.45,0:35:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.36,0:35:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what's the in-game world like?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.63,0:35:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.05,0:35:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.96,0:35:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's how they keep things confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.53,0:35:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The memories I make using\Ntheir rig in the VR world,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.19,0:35:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they don't stick with\Nme in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.19,0:36:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I saw during the\Ntests, whatever I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.11,0:36:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd forget all of it after I log out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.73,0:36:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.64,0:36:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't remember anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.67,0:36:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, is it another Augma?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.13,0:36:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.07,0:36:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rig doesn't put stress on\Nyour brain like the Ogma did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.07,0:36:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't lose my memories or anything, I\Njust can't access them from my Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.29,0:36:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Fluctlight what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.87,0:36:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to take\Nsome time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.63,0:36:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, the rig I'm testing\Nis called the Soul Translator.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.63,0:36:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in your body do\Nyou think your soul is?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.15,0:36:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.06,0:36:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.98,0:36:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.31,0:36:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you zoom into the brain,\Nyou'll see it's made up of cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.41,0:36:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, where in all those cells\Ndo you think the soul is?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.59,0:36:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.53,0:36:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoom into a brain cell\Nand you'll see that it has
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.33,0:36:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things in it that support\Nthe cell's structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.73,0:36:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're called microtubules.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.91,0:36:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.05,0:37:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the name implies,\Nthey're like hollow pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.05,0:37:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're not empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.47,0:37:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got something sealed inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.41,0:37:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do they have inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.37,0:37:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.05,0:37:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.35,0:37:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fluctuating light.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.97,0:37:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the building block of the\Nhuman soul, according to Rath.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.85,0:37:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me see if I understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.71,0:37:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're saying this light in brain cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.69,0:37:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the soul? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.35,0:37:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't call it a\Nsoul at Wrath, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.81,0:37:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They decided to go with a combination\Nof the words fluctuating and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.31,0:37:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fluctlight for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.69,0:37:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Soul Translator doesn't\Njust read a person's brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.23,0:37:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it reads their Fluctlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.95,0:37:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means it can also\Nimprint on them. Imprint?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.79,0:37:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the Amusphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.97,0:37:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That rig lets you experience\NVR by sending images,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.45,0:37:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sounds, and other sensory\Ninformation to your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.67,0:37:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this rig,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.97,0:37:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since it's next-gen and all, it would\Nwork the same way but on your soul, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.41,0:37:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.15,0:38:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name pretty much says it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.41,0:38:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Soul Translator, or STL,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.99,0:38:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,writes short-term memories\Nonto your Fluctlight
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.15,0:38:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the sights and sounds\Nit wants you to experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.37,0:38:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mnemonic visual data is what it's called.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.67,0:38:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember the test dives I took\Nat the beginning of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.45,0:38:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those dives were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.29,0:38:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.51,0:38:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like what\Nthe Amusphere creates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.29,0:38:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything was so real, I couldn't\Ntell it was a virtual world at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.83,0:38:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.03,0:38:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.05,0:38:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, is it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.15,0:38:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.06,0:38:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuoka offered you the job, and that's\Ngreat, but who knows what his motives are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.97,0:38:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right, but I don't\Nlet my guard down around him ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.33,0:38:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.67,0:38:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this to see\Nwhere full dive's heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.51,0:38:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's risky, but the STL's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.59,0:39:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, terms like mnemonic and flunctlights\Nsound creepy, but I connect with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.97,0:39:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way more than the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.81,0:39:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a waking dream\Nwhen I'm in it. How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.71,0:39:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how you sometimes\Nhave dreams that seem long?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.41,0:39:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kind where you wake up and you'd\Nswear that dream went on for hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.39,0:39:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially if it was a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.59,0:39:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, that dream probably\Nonly lasted a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.81,0:39:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get that same phenomena if\Nyou dive with the STL. Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just like a dream that felt like\Nhours but was only a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.15,0:39:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time diving with the STL\Nis way longer than your dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.85,0:39:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the main feature of the STL.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.61,0:39:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrath calls it Fluctlight\NAcceleration, or FLA for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.47,0:39:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.69,0:39:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.21,0:39:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My head's spinning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.99,0:39:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were diving for three whole days,\Nso how much time was that in VR?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.17,0:39:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.55,0:40:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could have been ten days or a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.11,0:40:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.71,0:40:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I asked how long,\Nthey wouldn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.05,0:40:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they did tell me the\Ncodename of the test world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.05,0:40:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.96,0:40:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.33,0:40:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.51,0:40:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's like an underground\Nworld? It's a reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.31,0:40:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to do with Alice, same as Raph.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.11,0:40:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice in Wonderland was the title\Nthe book was published under,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.95,0:40:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it had a different title\Nwhen it was being written.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.43,0:40:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Originally, it was called\NAlice's Adventures Underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.03,0:40:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I heard the name Alice, it felt\Nlike I was about to remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.39,0:40:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about the test?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.13,0:40:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.81,0:40:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like there's\Nsomething I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.77,0:40:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't remember what.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.53,0:40:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Egil. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.13,0:40:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you guys up to date about B.O.B.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.25,0:41:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks again for meeting up with me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.67,0:41:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.58,0:41:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, Sheenanone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.81,0:41:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.29,0:41:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.15,0:41:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.93,0:41:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.73,0:41:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.51,0:41:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.07,0:41:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.13,0:41:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To America? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.59,0:41:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The research is way more advanced there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.43,0:41:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all next-gen stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.39,0:41:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're creating a new world, and\NI want to be there when it's born.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.23,0:42:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were happy in Aincrad, but there\Nwas so much pain and sadness, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.09,0:42:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to find out why that\Ncastle still haunts your thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and where that experience is taking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.33,0:42:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I lived a couple hundred\Nyears, I doubt I'd ever find that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.45,0:42:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I want...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.75,0:42:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you with me, Asuna. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.65,0:42:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to come with me, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.21,0:42:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that's asking a\Nlot, but the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.89,0:42:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do this without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.73,0:42:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'll go anywhere with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.99,0:42:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.19,0:42:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.89,0:42:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.27,0:43:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does this mean the Soul\NTranslator isn't the next step in VR?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.69,0:43:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hearing you talk about\Nit, I thought it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.99,0:43:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.65,0:43:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I get the feeling its\Npurpose isn't just a full dive in VR worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.15,0:43:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what's it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.75,0:43:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tool for learning about\NFluctlights and human consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.91,0:43:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.03,0:43:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever I know about\Nthe STL makes me think
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.21,0:43:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might be an extension\Nof Kayaba's ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.05,0:43:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's behind it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.39,0:43:34.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why he made the NerveGear and
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.97,0:43:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SAO to trap everyone\Nand make us all suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.33,0:43:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or why he'd fry his own brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.93,0:43:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.13,0:43:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't make it just\Nto keep Fairy alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.27,0:43:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know what his endgame was.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.43,0:43:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want it to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.95,0:43:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not his puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.29,0:43:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I go down that road, I would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.89,0:43:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you talked to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.49,0:43:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the part of him he left behind. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.49,0:44:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know why he left\Na copy of himself out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.81,0:44:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it might have something to do\Nwith what Wrath's up to with the STL.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.61,0:44:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorry to bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.15,0:44:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sort of lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.69,0:44:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the station?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.13,0:44:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.77,0:44:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.57,0:44:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You followed us from Dicey's cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.61,0:44:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There goes my plan to ambush y 'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.27,0:44:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.33,0:44:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.13,0:44:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.85,0:44:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.57,0:44:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always wore a mask back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.73,0:44:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now that Zaza's been caught, there's\Nno one left to finish things but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.41,0:44:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last survivor of Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.59,0:44:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Johnny Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.99,0:44:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.39,0:45:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got no sword here!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.37,0:45:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're still on the run?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.13,0:45:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.91,0:45:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.99,0:45:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're the same\Ndude that beat the hell out of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.17,0:45:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're just a punk-ass kid, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.81,0:45:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take away your swords, and you're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.29,0:45:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.20,0:45:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have your poison dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.65,0:45:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.11,0:45:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.83,0:45:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.93,0:45:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.61,0:46:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.21,0:46:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
